From 503ffa49b8d33ee9d74753b16b58bd0009870ff3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 13:59:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(webview): stop WebView inverting img in dark mode via
 color-scheme: only light

web-to-app shell uses DARK_STRATEGY_PREFER_WEB_THEME_OVER_USER_AGENT_DARKENING,
which algorithmically inverts <img> (PNG avatars/logo) into a negative image
in dark mode. Declare imgs (and the avatar container holding inline SVG) as
color-scheme: only light so WebView's user-agent darkening skips them, while
the rest of the page keeps following the system theme.
---
 .../src/components/hermes/profiles/ProfileAvatar.vue      | 3 +++
 packages/client/src/styles/global.scss                    | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packages/client/src/components/hermes/profiles/ProfileAvatar.vue b/packages/client/src/components/hermes/profiles/ProfileAvatar.vue
index 5a07b681..d1a23418 100644
--- a/packages/client/src/components/hermes/profiles/ProfileAvatar.vue
+++ b/packages/client/src/components/hermes/profiles/ProfileAvatar.vue
@@ -40,6 +40,9 @@ const style = computed(() => ({
   border-radius: 50%;
   overflow: hidden;
   background: var(--bg-secondary);
+  /* Declare as still-light so WebView FORCE_DARK won't algorithmically
+     darken (invert) the avatar image/inline SVG in the shell APK. */
+  color-scheme: only light;
 }
 
 .profile-avatar-image,
diff --git a/packages/client/src/styles/global.scss b/packages/client/src/styles/global.scss
index 1a71541c..bac95403 100644
--- a/packages/client/src/styles/global.scss
+++ b/packages/client/src/styles/global.scss
@@ -64,6 +64,14 @@ textarea {
   font-family: inherit;
 }
 
+/* WebView (web-to-app) 壳在 FORCE_DARK 下会对 <img> 做 user-agent 算法反色，
+   导致 PNG 头像/logo 变成负片。img 是内容图片（非跟随主题的 UI 图元），
+   用 per-element opt-out 声明为仅浅色，阻止 WebView 对图片反色，
+   不影响页面其他部分跟随系统深浅。 */
+img {
+  color-scheme: only light;
+}
+
 :root {
   --vh: 1vh;
 }
-- 
